MC6809 0.6.0: sign-extend negative B into A as well as clearing A for
nonnegative B. The missing branch corrupts valid generated arithmetic
shifts. This fixes the test emulator, not GCC or the target libraries.
Regression: tests/review/check_sex_opcode.py (all 65,536 initial D values).

--- a/MC6809/components/mc6809_base.py
+++ b/MC6809/components/mc6809_base.py
@@ -858,5 +858,7 @@
         b = self.accu_b.value
         if b & 0x80 == 0:
             self.accu_a.set(0x00)
+        else:
+            self.accu_a.set(0xff)

         d = self.accu_d.value
